 class=\"token key atrule\">category</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> AI工具/Claude\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">cssclasses</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> ai<span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span>tool\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> series\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> index\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">note</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean important\">true</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">series</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> Claude Code 源码深度解析</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<div data-callout-metadata=\"\" data-callout-fold=\"\" data-callout=\"info\" class=\"callout drop-shadow\"><div class=\"callout-title\" dir=\"auto\"><div class=\"callout-icon\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-info\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"callout-title-inner\">文档定位</div></div><div class=\"callout-content ab-note\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AI 整理 + 学习笔记</strong>。原文出自杨艺韬《Claude Code 源码深度解析》一书。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">原文链接:<a rel=\"noopener nofollow\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.yangyitao.com/books/claude-code\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.yangyitao.com/books/claude-code</a><br>\n系列入口:<a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/README/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/README/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">大模型/Claude Code 源码深度解析/README</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>第一本深入 AI 编程助手内核的架构专著。</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">本书以 Claude Code 完整源码（2026.3.31 泄露版本）为解剖对象，逐层拆解 CLI 启动优化、流式 Query 引擎、工具编排系统、多模式权限模型、MCP 协议集成、IDE Bridge 通信、多 Agent 协调等核心子系统。51 万行代码、40+ 工具、80+ 命令——无论你是否使用 Claude Code，都能从中学到构建 AI Agent 系统的核心设计模式。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"适合谁读\" dir=\"auto\">适合谁读</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">有 TypeScript 经验的前端/全栈工程师、AI 应用开发者、Agent 框架设计者，以及所有想理解\"AI 编程助手到底是怎么工作的\"技术人。</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"目录\" dir=\"auto\">目录</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"开篇\" dir=\"auto\">开篇</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"大模型/Claude Code 源码深度解析/前言\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E5%89%8D%E8%A8%80/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">前言</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第1章-为什么需要理解-Claude-Code\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3-Claude-Code/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC1%E7%AB%A0-%E4%B8%BA%E4%BB%80%E4%B9%88%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%90%86%E8%A7%A3-Claude-Code/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第1章 为什么需要理解 Claude Code</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-heading=\"第二部分：启动与核心循环\" dir=\"auto\">第二部分：启动与核心循环</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第2章-架构总览\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0-%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%80%BB%E8%A7%88/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC2%E7%AB%A0-%E6%9E%B6%E6%9E%84%E6%80%BB%E8%A7%88/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第2章 架构总览</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第3章-CLI-启动与性能优化\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC3%E7%AB%A0-CLI-%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC3%E7%AB%A0-CLI-%E5%90%AF%E5%8A%A8%E4%B8%8E%E6%80%A7%E8%83%BD%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第3章 CLI 启动与性能优化</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第4章-Query-引擎-Agent-的心脏\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AB%A0-Query-%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E-Agent-%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%83%E8%84%8F/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC4%E7%AB%A0-Query-%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E-Agent-%E7%9A%84%E5%BF%83%E8%84%8F/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">第4章 Query 引擎：Agent 的心脏</a></li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-tooltip-position=\"top\" aria-label=\"第5章-流式消息与状态机\" data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%BA%A6%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/%E7%AC%AC5%E7%AB%A0-%E6%B5%81%E5%BC%8F%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF%E4%B8%8E%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%9C%BA/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/Claude%20Code%20%E6%BA%90%E7%A0%81%E6%B7%B1%E5%